{"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/9Ensembles15CloudFileSystemP","doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This backend communicates directly with Google’s REST API — no third-party SDK","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is required. Authentication is handled via an OAuth 2.0 access token passed as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bearer"},{"text":" header on every request.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Google Drive uses file IDs rather than paths to identify files and folders.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This backend bridges the path-based ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CloudFileSystem"},{"text":" protocol onto Google Drive’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ID-based API by walking the folder hierarchy to resolve Ensembles paths","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ensembleId\/events\/file.json"},{"text":") to Google Drive folder and file IDs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Resolved IDs are cached in internal dictionaries to minimize API calls. The cache","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is invalidated when items are deleted or when not-found errors indicate stale entries.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two initialization paths are available:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Simple: static access token (app manages refresh externally)","let cloudFS = GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem(accessToken: \"your-token\")","","\/\/ Authenticator: auto-refreshes expired tokens","let cloudFS = GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem(authenticator: authenticator)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Setup","text":"Setup"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Go to the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/console.cloud.google.com\/"},{"type":"text","text":" and create a project"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enable the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Google Drive API"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" under "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"APIs & Services → Library"}],"type":"emphasis"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create an "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OAuth 2.0 Client ID"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" under "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"APIs & Services → Credentials"}],"type":"emphasis"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For iOS\/macOS apps, choose “iOS” application type and enter your bundle ID","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set the redirect URI (typically ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.googleusercontent.apps.YOUR-CLIENT-ID:\/oauthredirect","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure the authenticator and file system:"}]}]}]},{"code":["let config = GoogleDriveAuthenticator.Configuration(","    clientID: \"YOUR-CLIENT-ID.apps.googleusercontent.com\",","    redirectURI: \"com.googleusercontent.apps.YOUR-CLIENT-ID:\/oauthredirect\"",")","let authenticator = GoogleDriveAuthenticator(configuration: config)","try await authenticator.authorize(presenting: window)","","let cloudFS = GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem(authenticator: authenticator)","let ensemble = CoreDataEnsemble(","    ensembleIdentifier: \"MyStore\",","    persistentStoreURL: storeURL,","    managedObjectModelURL: modelURL,","    cloudFileSystem: cloudFS",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The authenticator stores tokens in the Keychain and refreshes them automatically","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when they expire. The default scope is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drive.file"},{"text":" (per-file access), which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"limits the app to files it creates.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Threading","text":"Threading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This class is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@unchecked Sendable"},{"text":". All network calls go through a shared","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLSession"},{"text":" instance, which is thread-safe. Mutable state (caches, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"loggedIn"},{"text":" flag)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is accessed only from async methods that are serialized by the ensemble’s operation queue.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A cloud file system backed by the Google Drive REST API v3 using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLSession"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ensemblesgoogledrive\/googledrivecloudfilesystem"]}],"metadata":{"t